===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Litten|26}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*'''Flare''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Growlithe|28}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
